<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
        <title>403 | DevSpot</title>
        <style>
            :root {
                color-scheme: dark;
            }

            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            body {
                margin: 0;
                min-height: 100vh;
                font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
                background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.24), transparent 42%),
                    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.14), transparent 45%),
                    #020617;
                color: #e2e8f0;
                display: grid;
                place-items: center;
                padding: 24px;
            }

            .card {
                width: min(720px, 100%);
                border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
                border-radius: 28px;
                background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
                backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
                box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
                padding: 34px;
            }

            .badge {
                display: inline-block;
                margin-bottom: 14px;
                border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.35);
                color: #fde68a;
                background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12);
                border-radius: 999px;
                padding: 6px 12px;
                font-size: 12px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: .08em;
                text-transform: uppercase;
            }

            h1 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.7rem);
                line-height: 1.1;
                color: #f8fafc;
            }

            p {
                margin: 14px 0 0;
                color: #94a3b8;
                line-height: 1.6;
            }

            .actions {
                margin-top: 24px;
                display: flex;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 10px;
            }

            a {
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 999px;
                padding: 11px 16px;
                font-weight: 700;
                font-size: 14px;
                transition: transform .2s ease, opacity .2s ease;
            }

            a:hover {
                transform: translateY(-1px);
                opacity: .95;
            }

            .primary {
                background: #10b981;
                color: #052e2b;
            }

            .ghost {
                border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
                color: #e2e8f0;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <main class="card">
            <span class="badge">Erreur 403</span>
            <h1>Accès refusé.</h1>
            <p>Cette ressource est privée ou tu n’as pas les droits nécessaires.</p>
            <div class="actions">
                <a class="primary" href="{{ path('app_home') }}">Retour à l’accueil</a>
                <a class="ghost" href="javascript:history.back()">Page précédente</a>
            </div>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>
